    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C09_Gilgamesh_15:SubEv_C09_Gilgamesh_15_002:edaac145",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_SubEv_C09_Gilgamesh_15",
        "key": "SubEv_C09_Gilgamesh_15_002",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C09_Gilgamesh_15:SubEv_C09_Gilgamesh_15_002:edaac145",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C09_Gilgamesh_15:SubEv_C09_Gilgamesh_15_002:edaac145",
        "jp_sha256": "779858692096913bbf10abf3650d220029605111e2b74f7b43b83b85abcc8344",
        "official_en_sha256": "23426b0135e427700c47f5829faa24352a699ba30a89b54b94b4913f83791e19"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "だが、思い出すぜ！　オレの戦いの記憶を……\r\n覚悟を決めたやつの強さを知った、あの戦いを！",
        "official_en": "Yet I now remember my battle on that bridge...the battle where I first witnessed the overwhelming power of a certain individual—one who was driven by unwavering determination!",
        "real_en": "But I remember that battle! The battle where I learned just how strong someone can be when they're truly determined!"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
