        "official_en_sha256": "f24508c2226823186be03b49cb6611b924c5626076de494c6ba51aafb9654c99"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "とにかく、これでオレを倒す理由ができたぞ！\r\n本気で来い、レイン！",
        "official_en": "Let us move on to saber-STABBING, now that you have a reason to defeat me! Come at me with all you’ve got, Rain!",
        "real_en": "Anyway, now you've got a reason to beat me! Come at me with everything you've got, Rain!"
      },
