        "key": "SubEv_C09_Gilgamesh_15_003",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C09_Gilgamesh_15:SubEv_C09_Gilgamesh_15_003:fbefc1b0",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C09_Gilgamesh_15:SubEv_C09_Gilgamesh_15_003:fbefc1b0",
        "jp_sha256": "113e42981d79ae1c018bc2dcaa56e1981527effffdc3ba2b96ea7a47ad762bb6",
        "official_en_sha256": "527c848072b07f721fb399dc06c0f5f1b352f6d8155ac828113ee574c385997f"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "オレのなくした記憶を……かけがえのない思い出を\r\nよみがえらせてくれた、この橋はまさしく……",
        "official_en": "It was not “Tall Bridge”...nor “Grand Bridge”...not “Large Bridge” nor “Long Bridge”...and certainly not “Bridge of Considerable Size”...no, it was...",
        "real_en": "This bridge brought back the memories I'd lost... precious memories. It truly is..."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
